Third-party language data
-------------------------
Dutch spelling forms were validated with the OpenTaal Dutch word list.
Creator: Stichting OpenTaal.
Source: https://github.com/OpenTaal/opentaal-wordlist
License: Revised BSD License and/or CC BY 3.0.
A copy of the applicable license is included in data/OpenTaal-LICENSE.txt.

The verb atlas is an adaptation generated from curated verb roots, morphological
rules and spelling validation; it is not a reproduction of Van Dale content.

Pattern Dutch verb morphology
-----------------------------
The file data/sources/pattern-nl-verbs.txt is derived from the Dutch verb
resource distributed with Pattern by the University of Antwerp. It is used
only as a morphology comparison source for the manually written core review.
Pattern is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license. A copy is included in
data/Pattern-LICENSE.txt.
Source repository: https://github.com/clips/pattern

